1. d4 d5 2. Nf3 Nf6 3. Bf4 e6 4. e3 c5 { We play london here } 5. c4 Nc6 6. Nc3 Be7 7. Be2 dxc4 8. Bxc4 O-O 9. O-O cxd4 10. Nxd4 Nxd4 11. Qxd4 Qxd4 12. exd4 { I exchange everything because I know there is a isolated pawn. Ill grind it in the end game } 12... a6 13. Rfd1 b5 { ni kuha kog dako nga space sa queen side para lamang ika end game } 14. Bb3 Bb7 15. d5 exd5 16. Nxd5 Bxd5 17. Bxd5 Nxd5 18. Rxd5 Bf6 19. Be5 Bxe5 20. Rxe5 f6 21. Re2 Kf7 { king must be active } 22. a4 b4 23. a5 Rfe8 24. Kf1 Rab8 25. Ra4 Rxe2 26. Kxe2 Ke6 27. Kd3 Kd5 28. Ra1 { On this point I know Im winning. } 28... Rb5 29. b3 { Pero ga lisod kog grind kay dying seconds nalang ko } 29... Rc5 30. Kd2 Kd4 31. Ra4 Rb5 32. Kc2 h5 33. h3 g5 34. Ra1 Rc5+ 35. Kd2 f5 36. f3 f4 37. Ra4 Rb5 38. Ra1 h4 { My time here is around 5-8 seconds. Im relying to my increment } 39. Ra2 Rc5 40. Ra4 Rb5 41. Ra1 { I regret why I keep writing the notations here. I can win here if I focus to the game and stop writing the notations } *


